{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22489","headline":"曲江感秋二首 一 · 白居易","name":"曲江感秋二首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"元和二年秋，我年三十七。\n长庆二年秋，我年五十一。\n中间十四年，六年居谴黜。\n穷通与荣悴，委运随外物。\n遂师庐山远，重吊湘江屈。\n夜听竹枝愁，秋看灩堆没。\n近辞巴郡印，又秉纶闱笔。\n晚遇何足言，白发映朱绂。\n销沈昔意气，改换旧容质。\n独有曲江秋，风烟如往日。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22489.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22489","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}